    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nnterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ieSherry FitzGerald Conor McManus are pleased to present to the market No. 22 St. Patrick's Terrace, Monaghan, Co. Monaghan.A terraced town house which in the right hands could result in the perfect combination of style and location.The property is part of a mature 26 house development and no. 22 is positioned with a verdant view over the old railway line to the front.Accommodation in brief comprises an open living room/ kitchen on the ground floor. Upstairs are two bedrooms and the bathroom. The property benefits from an enclosed front garden while to the rear is a sizeable garden in lawn.The location of this property is simply ideal, a stones throw from town centre, The Peace Campus, Bus Station, Lidl to name a few.Properties within this highly regarded development are seldom offered for sale, making this a particularly rare and appealing opportunity for discerning purchasers. Combining the convenience and low-maintenance appeal often associated with apartment living with the privacy, space and independence of a house, this property offers buyers an attractive alternative to the conventional apartment market.Viewing reccomended and strictly by appointment only with the agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nOpen living room/ kitchen: - \nSpacious open-plan kitchen and living area featuring a fitted kitchen, open fireplace and staircase to the first floor.\n\nBathroom: - \nFitted with bath and overhead electric shower, WC and tiled walls around the bath area.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nWell-proportioned bedroom with carpet flooring and timber skirting.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nBright bedroom with carpet flooringand window overlooking the rear garden.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Total Floor Area: 46.8 sq mts (504 sq. ft. approx.)</li><li>Excellent location on the edge of town centre</li><li>Conveniently located adjacent to The Peace Campus,Lidl, Monaghan Bus Station </li><li>Mature and tranquil residential area of only 26 properties </li><li>Enclosed garden to the front & rear</li><li>Oil fired central heating</li><li>Broadband available</li><li>Mains services</ul>"
      },
      {
